  "description": "The Rask browser runtime: runs a Rask app's C# components client-side on .NET WebAssembly. Ships the JS boot scripts, the page shell, and the MSBuild integration that stages them into the published bundle — and, opted in, prerenders every route to static HTML with a sitemap.xml at publish, so a static host serves real pages to visitors and crawlers. Includes Rask.Core and the Rask source generators.",
